# state: first-run
# lane.vcpuwait433 (#433), 2026-10-03: the v5 route (tron-newgame.route, no DOWN) below, unchanged,
# declared first-run so the Tron B arm reaches the in-engine intro under either dispatcher.
# Why not tron-newgame-returning: at 08:00 PDT the dispatcher workers ran a 10-02 07:55 snapshot of
# a host tree at 66bce0c222, without savestate433, so `# state: returning` was not enforced and the
# disk held the first-run leftover d2aff0a53543 (Auto Load greyed): the DOWN would land on Light
# Cycles (tron1). With no Tron profile, from that leftover or from savestate433 composing first-run,
# A on Single Player picks New Game and the run plays the intro, the window of A (990012) and tron2.
# Tron 2.0: Killer App (42560001), Nova, lane.tronhang672 (#672).
# tron-2-killer-app.route (lane.titleroutes2) with one change: a DOWN
# before the A on the Single Player menu, so it picks New Game.
# Why: the hang (1790971658-lanelocal-1220020) came at the second load,
# after New Game's first load and ~4.5 min of in-engine intro. That run left
# a save, and since then the Single Player cursor starts on Auto Load
# (0-1790974820-tronhang672-2186958, route-frame 140237), which skips the
# intro and goes straight to the second load; there it did not hang.
# Menu map from 1790971658's route-frames: START on the main menu does
# nothing, A opens Single Player (130943); START does nothing there, A on
# New Game opens the difficulty box (130954, Normal lit); A loads (131005).
# Inputs after that are the base route's, unchanged.
# v2: START at ~80 s, not ~64 s. In 0-1790975634-tronhang672-2276276 the
# ESRB card was still up at 64 s (141524) and the title came at 141535, so
# START hit the card, B hit the title, and the run looped the sign-in.
# v3: no single START time works. In 0-1790976263-tronhang672-2397053 the
# attract video was up at 80 s (142828); START dropped it to the title
# (142846) and B landed on the title again. So press START until the sign-in
# must be up: START is a no-op on the sign-in (141547), the title needs one,
# the attract video one more, and the ESRB card ignores it (141524). Five
# STARTs 7 s apart from 55 s cover 55-90 s; then the one B.
# v5 (lane.vcpuwait433, 2026-10-02): no DOWN. The Nova's hdd.img no longer
# holds a Tron save: in capture tron1 (perf/2026-10-02-vcpuwait433/tron1,
# route-frame 185013) Auto Load and Load Game are greyed and the cursor starts
# on New Game, so v4's DOWN skipped the greyed Load Game to Light Cycles
# (185021) and the menu loop ended in Options > Display (185202, 59 fps).
# Without the DOWN, A picks the top enabled entry: New Game (no save, the
# path near30 decomposed) or Auto Load (a save, straight to a level). Either
# way the run ends in-level, not in a menu. Check 'menu-cursor' to see which.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 15
repeat 5 {
    press START
    wait 7
    shot boot-start
}
shot signin
shot signin
press B
wait 5
shot skip
press START
wait 5
shot menu-start
press A
wait 5
shot menu-a
press START
wait 5
shot menu-start
wait 2
shot menu-cursor
press A
wait 5
shot menu-a
repeat 8 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
mark gameplay               # blind: fires during the intro cutscenes
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 3
    shot fwd
    axis RT max
    wait 1
    axis RT min
    wait 1
    axis RX max
    wait 0.4
    axis RX mid
    wait 1
    shot right
    press A
    wait 2
    axis RX min
    wait 0.4
    axis RX mid
    wait 1
    shot left
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.5
}
